  THE SUBJECT RATHER THAN FROM SPECULATION:

  1. THE ENGINE EXPOSES NO TAINT-DISABLING SWITCH AT ALL. Opengrep 1.27.1's
     complete taint-option set is two entries, and both ENABLE behaviour:
       --guarded-taint-signatures   (help line 192; REQUIRES --experimental)
